              "Unresolved": "UNRESOLVED (p.314, 271): vermin screen position - the end segment is a solid envelope in the model (its diaphragm opening is not built) and the screen bottom is read at the top of the 10\u0022 bottom slab of p.271 Section A-A. Envelope 10\u0027-2\u0022 wide to 3\u0027-2\u0022, stepped to the 3\u0027-6\u0022 door at 6\u0027-0\u0022 (sloped sides enveloped), 3\u0022 deep (L3x3 frames), on the anchor face; wire cloth, door, hinges and anchors not modeled separately."
