          "Unresolved": [
            "UNRESOLVED (p.42): 36\u0022 pile void ends - the 21\u0022 void has conical end fittings and the 13\u0027-0\u0022 head solid section is measured from the cast head (up to 2\u0027-0\u0022 may be cut off in the field). Void with flat ends, 13\u0027-0\u0022 solid below the modeled head and 11\u0027-0\u0022 above the tip; 1\u0022 chamfers.",
            "UNRESOLVED (p.322): deck drains in the bent segments, end segments and closure joints - note 4 says \u0027one drain per segment\u0027 without saying whether the split bent segments, the end segments and the cast-in-place closures get one. Drains only in the 242 typical segments.",
            "UNRESOLVED (p.161, 407 vs p.271): end segment face vs the CL joint - S3-23 places the anchor face 10\u0022 from the bent control line (Section A-A, scaled) while the S2-19 / S4-15 joint sections draw it ~3\u0022 from it. Model keeps the S3 end segment (10\u0022); derived joint openings 3\u0027-9\u0022 (bent 18) / 4\u0027-1\u0022 (bent 29) = twice the distance anchor face - CL joint.",
            "UNRESOLVED (p.392): navigational lights, junction boxes and 10/3 MC cable - they are by others and located only relative to the navigation channel (green CL light, red margin lights 100\u0027-0\u0022 each side, both parapets); the channel CL station is not given (every span 20-28 has a platform). Not built.",
            "UNRESOLVED (p.385-391): box girder lighting conduit runs, hoist receptacles at the bents, grounding - the conduit layout is left to the contractor\u0027s shop drawings (p.387 note 1) and the hoist receptacles / grounding plates at the bents are not dimensioned. Not built.",
            "UNRESOLVED (p.317-320): disc bearing details - vendor-designed bearings; the generic bearing block of build-bonner-unit5.csx stays. Not modeled.",
            "UNRESOLVED (p.44-57 (S0-43..54)): utility conduit system in spans 19-29 (electrical \u002B fiber optic hangers on -L-, optional floor splice boxes) - the hanger spacing / conduit profile vary and the splice box locations are per the utility working drawings, not in this set. Not modeled."
          ]
        }
